{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15012","headline":"春日灞亭同苗员外寄皇甫侍御 · 卢纶","name":"春日灞亭同苗员外寄皇甫侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坐见春云暮，无因报所思。\n川平人去远，日暖鴈飞迟。\n对酒山长在，看花鬓自衰。\n谁堪登灞岸，还作旧乡悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15012.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15012","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}